00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:22.680
made me extremely bored,

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:26.160
bored enough that editing
videos and being highly creative

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:29.730
and doing what I love actually
felt entertaining as well.

00:07:29.730 --> 00:07:31.290
So there's a perfect example

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:33.600
of my environmental conditioning

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:36.660
helping facilitate a mindset

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:39.930
of creativity and
attitude of productivity.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:42.720
It's because I had very few other options.

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:43.920
So in summary,

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:46.710
if you have something
you need to do right now,

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:50.460
then eliminate all your back
doors, turn off your phone,

00:07:50.460 --> 00:07:52.770
remove your gaming PC from your room,

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:54.120
remove your Xbox.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:55.440
Auto hide the toolbar

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:58.830
so when you're thinking
of the next word to write,

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:01.620
you don't look at Safari and
automatically click on it.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.150
And in living life this way

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:05.100
